    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that experts say that, but it feels like a very \"official\" answer. People are seeing specific issues like missing chain of custody logs or ballots showing up in weird places. If there's even a small chance it's being messed with, shouldn't we be treating those concerns as legitimate risks instead of just calling them \"complex\"?",
